OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain soon
OL,6,Fclears Shetland but murky conditions
OL,7,Fremain this evening with a risk of
OL,8,Ffog. Largely clear conditions for
OL,9,FOrkney will spread to Shetland later.
OL,10,FWinds easing somewhat through the
OL,11,Fnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FMostly dry with plenty of
OL,14,Fsunshine. Orkney will have a sunny
OL,15,Fmorning, with low risk of the odd
OL,16,Fshower in the afternoon. Patchy rain
OL,17,Fpossible for Shetland in the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
