OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FShowers
OL,6,For longer spells of rain on Friday
OL,7,Finterspersed with some bright spells.
OL,8,FThe weekend will be largely cloudy and
OL,9,Fwindy with patchy rain at times.
